{"id":610,"date":"2026-08-15T19:21:10","date_gmt":"2026-08-15T19:21:10","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=610"},"modified":"2026-08-16T07:21:55","modified_gmt":"2026-08-16T07:21:55","slug":"page-borders","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/master-themes\/page-borders\/","title":{"rendered":"Page Borders"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Page Borders<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-631\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Borders-1.png\" alt=\"Page Borders\" width=\"144\" height=\"183\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Borders-1.png 253w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Borders-1-236x300.png 236w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 144px) 100vw, 144px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher includes a library of 100 unique decorative page border styles, all drawn using scalable mathematical SVG paths. Because they are vector-based rather than CSS approximations, they scale proportionally to any document size without loss of quality, and they support custom colours and thickness.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">How to Apply a Border<\/span><\/h3>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-634\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BordersQuestionmark.webp\" alt=\"How to Apply a Border\" width=\"105\" height=\"134\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BordersQuestionmark.webp 253w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/BordersQuestionmark-236x300.webp 236w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 105px) 100vw, 105px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Borders tool is accessible from two locations in the ribbon:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Page Design<\/strong> tab.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Insert<\/strong> tab (under Graphics).<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\">Click the <strong>Borders<\/strong> button to open a scrollable dropdown menu featuring:<\/p>\n<table style=\"width: 76.1959%;\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\">\n<tbody>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td style=\"width: 30%;\" bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"30%\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Category<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9695%;\" bgcolor=\"#007670\" width=\"70%\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Examples<\/b><\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Classic &amp; Technical<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9695%;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Solid, Dashed, Blueprint, Pinstripe, Barcode.<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Geometric Corners<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9695%;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Plaque, Ticket, Diamond, Target, Octagon.<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Layered &amp; 3D<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9695%;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Outset, Groove, Echo, Neon.<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Craft &amp; Deco<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 49.9695%;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Filmstrip, Double-Stitch, Photo-Corners, Art Deco.<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Customisation options in the dropdown:<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-613\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-201740.png\" alt=\"Customisation options in the dropdown\" width=\"331\" height=\"231\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-201740.png 965w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-201740-300x210.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-15-201740-768x536.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 331px) 100vw, 331px\" \/><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">10-colour quick-select palette for instant colour changes.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Custom hex colour picker for any specific colour.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Thickness slider to dial in precise pixel weights.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><!-- PLACEHOLDER FOR NANO BANANA SCREENSHOT: BORDERS DROPDOWN MENU --><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">The dropdown renders an accurate 1:1 scaled preview of each border style (using the exact same SVG math used on the actual page, scaled down proportionally to a small card), so you know exactly what you will get before applying it.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Border Behaviour<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-614\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/2.png\" alt=\"Border Behaviour\" width=\"423\" height=\"246\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/2.png 926w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/2-300x174.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/2-768x446.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 423px) 100vw, 423px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Once applied, a border is permanently anchored to the background of your page with <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">pointer-events: none<\/span> applied, meaning it cannot be accidentally dragged or selected while you work on your design. It is fully print-safe and will appear correctly in all export formats.<\/p>\n<p><!-- PLACEHOLDER FOR NANO BANANA SCREENSHOT: APPLIED BORDER ON CANVAS --><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Page Borders Open Publisher includes a library of 100 unique decorative page border styles, all drawn using scalable mathematical SVG paths. Because they are vector-based rather than CSS approximations, they scale proportionally to any document size without loss of quality, and they support custom colours and thickness. How to Apply a Border The Borders tool [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":638,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[10],"class_list":["post-610","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-master-themes"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/610","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=610"}],"version-history":[{"count":19,"href":"ht